  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HKphpcF.png\" alt=\"Plushie Mod\" width=\"856\" height=\"112\"></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>這個模組為你的遊戲添加了許多可愛的 Minecraft 布偶！</em></h1><p><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bQC6j31.png\" alt=\"布偶\" width=\"841\" height=\"442\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em><br></em></span></p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\">重要資訊：</span></strong></em><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em><br></em></span></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">v1.3 以上版本需要 Architectury API！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">若使用 Fabric，還需要 Fabric API！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">請在<a href=\"https://gist.github.com/Link4real/c465b77b9dd02802ca35197f6db3500b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>幫助我們翻譯模組！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">此模組未來將會持續更新。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>請注意：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em>非官方 Minecraft 產品。</em></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em>未經 Mojang 或 Microsoft 批准或與其相關。</em></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><img style=\"text-align:center\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LMC7eqB.png\" alt=\"Plushie Mod 3D\" width=\"364\" height=\"205\"><br></span></p><h1><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><a href=\"https://gist.github.com/Link4real/af545420163c11858c4f4640b00191cd\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3L7vkvu.png\" alt=\"Github Gist 連結\" width=\"390\" height=\"122\"></a></span></h1>",
